---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; const title='Privacy Policy | VoxelCurve'; const description='VoxelCurve privacy policy.';
---
<BaseLayout {title} {description} canonical="https://voxelcurve.com/privacy"><section class="hero"><div class="container prose"><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>VoxelCurve is designed to work without an account. Blueprint calculations run in your browser. Build-progress data may be stored locally in your browser so your current build can be resumed on the same device.</p><h2>Local storage</h2><p>Local build-progress data is not automatically synced to VoxelCurve servers. Clearing browser site data may remove it.</p><h2>Analytics and advertising</h2><p>When analytics or advertising services are enabled, this policy will be updated to describe the providers, purposes and consent choices required by applicable law.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Privacy questions can be sent through the contact information published on the Contact page.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
